---
import '../../games/landroid-extended/style.css';
import FlightDialogs from '../../games/landroid-extended/Dialogs.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#16161d" />
    <meta name="description" content="驾驶飞船探索星系。" />
    <link
      rel="icon"
      href="/images/landroid-extended-icon.svg"
      type="image/svg+xml"
    />
    <link
      rel="preload"
      href="/fonts/landroid-extended-mono.ttf"
      as="font"
      type="font/ttf"
      crossorigin
    />
    <title>Landroid extended · galaxyrio</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main id="flight" aria-label="Landroid extended">
      <canvas
        id="universe"
        tabindex="0"
        role="application"
        aria-label="太空飞行。使用鼠标或单指拖动控制方向和推力，点击 AUTO 自动驾驶。边缘编号三角指向星球。"
        aria-describedby="flight-help"
      >
        此游戏需要支持 Canvas 的浏览器。
      </canvas>
      <div class="catalog hud" aria-label="星系与已探索天体">
        <pre id="star-catalog"></pre>
        <pre id="body-catalog"></pre>
      </div>
      <nav class="command-bar" aria-label="游戏菜单">
        <div class="flight-heading hud">
          <span class="game-mark">LANDROID <span>extended</span></span><output
            id="flight-score"
            class="flight-score"
            aria-label="当前得分"
            ><span>SCORE</span> <b id="score-value">5000</b></output
          >
        </div>
        <button
          id="menu-button"
          class="menu-button"
          aria-label="打开飞行菜单"
          title="菜单"
          ><svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            fill="currentColor"
            ><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.5"></circle><circle
              cx="12"
              cy="12"
              r="1.5"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.5"></circle></svg
          ></button
        >
      </nav>
      <div class="flight-console hud">
        <pre id="autopilot-telemetry" class="autopilot" hidden></pre>
        <div class="console-row">
          <pre id="ship-telemetry"></pre>
          <button
            id="autopilot-button"
            class="console-button"
            aria-label="自动驾驶"
            aria-pressed="false"
            title="自动驾驶">AUTO</button
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <p id="flight-help" class="first-hint hud">
        按住并拖动，调整朝向与推力<br /><span
          >松手后保持惯性 · AUTO 自动探索</span
        >
      </p>
      <p
        id="announcement"
        class="announcement"
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
      >
      </p>
      <canvas id="planet-guides" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <div id="failure" class="failure" hidden>
        <p id="failure-text"></p><a href="/?game=landroid-extended"
          >返回游戏库</a
        >
      </div>
    </main>
    <dialog id="flight-menu" aria-labelledby="menu-title">
      <form method="dialog" class="menu-top">
        <span>FLIGHT PAUSED</span><button
          class="menu-close"
          aria-label="关闭菜单">×</button
        >
      </form>
      <h1 id="menu-title">Landroid<span>extended</span></h1>
      <p class="menu-description">驾驶飞船探索星系。</p>
      <button id="resume-button" class="resume-button"
        >继续飞行 <span>↗</span></button
      >
      <div class="menu-actions">
        <button id="fullscreen-button">全屏</button>
        <button id="hide-hud-button">隐藏界面</button>
      </div>
      <div class="menu-actions">
        <button id="open-flight-leaderboard">排行榜</button><button
          id="show-flight-result"
          hidden>本局得分</button
        ><button id="new-flight">新的星系</button>
      </div>
      <details open>
        <summary>飞行指南 <span>CONTROLS</span></summary>
        <p>
          在画面任意位置按住并拖动。内圈调整朝向，拖出内圈开始推进，越远推力越大。
        </p>
        <p>屏幕边缘的有指向所有星球的引导。</p>
        <p>
          着陆时让船头朝外、支脚朝向地面。落地后展开旗帜，发现天体信息。持续推进一秒即可起飞。
        </p>
        <p>
          AUTO 会寻找尚未探索的行星，着陆停留
          一段时间，然后再继续旅程。手动操作随时接管飞船。
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>计分规则 <span>SCORE</span></summary>
        <p>首次着陆新星球时，相对速度越低、降落越垂直得分越高。</p>
        <p>飞船在飞行中会根据时间和耗油量持续扣分。</p>
        <p>AUTO模式不计分。</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>显示 <span>DISPLAY</span></summary>
        <label class="toggle-row"
          ><span>坐标网格</span><input
            id="grid-setting"
            type="checkbox"
            checked
          /></label
        >
        <label class="toggle-row"
          ><span>引力场</span><input
            id="gravity-setting"
            type="checkbox"
            checked
          /></label
        >
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>星系 <span>UNIVERSE</span></summary>
        <p id="current-system"></p>
        <p>新旅程会替换当前飞行存档。</p>
        <form id="seed-form" class="seed-form">
          <label for="seed-input">星系种子</label>
          <div>
            <input
              id="seed-input"
              type="text"
              inputmode="numeric"
              pattern="[0-9]{1,10}"
              maxlength="10"
              required
            /><button type="submit">出发 ↗</button>
          </div>
        </form>
        <div class="universe-actions">
          <button id="daily-system">今日星系</button><button id="random-system"
            >随机星系</button
          >
        </div>
      </details>
      <div class="menu-footer">
        <span id="save-state">进度保存在当前浏览器</span><a
          href="/?game=landroid-extended">返回游戏库 ↗</a
        >
      </div>
      <p class="credits">
        Based on <a
          href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android17-release/packages/EasterEgg/src/com/android/egg/landroid/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">AOSP Landroid</a
        > · <a href="/licenses/landroid-extended.txt" target="_blank"
          >Apache 2.0</a
        >
      </p>
    </dialog>
    <FlightDialogs />
    <noscript
      ><p class="failure">
        开启 JavaScript 后即可驾驶飞船。<a href="/">返回游戏库</a>
      </p></noscript
    >
    <script>
      import { startGame } from '../../games/landroid-extended/client';
      startGame();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
